```mermaid
flowchart TD
U[User Query] --> CS[ChatService]
CS --> IR[intent_router]

IR --> CMD{Command}
CMD -->|clear/compress| CTRL[CommandControl]
CMD -->|normal or skill/mcp| STRUCT[Structured Intent]

STRUCT --> CR[capability_router]

CR --> CHAT[chat_responder]
CR --> APP[app_executor]
CR --> FAST[fast_react]
CR --> PLAN[planner]

FAST --> REG[Capability Registry]
PLAN --> REG

REG --> TOOL[tool_execute]
APP --> TOOL

TOOL --> STATE[GraphState Evidence Results]

STATE --> VER[execution_verifier]

VER --> FINAL[final]

VER -->|retry| FAST
VER -->|replan| PLAN

FINAL --> END
CTRL --> END
```
